# M1, member a (k10, slot 0): own menus in stag0101 (docs/SEAMLESS.md 5.3, round 63). a arrives alone, opens its
# menu among the goburi and is hit while it is alone in its instance; b joins while the menu is open and fights the
# goburi beside a while they go on hitting a. Then a's menu while b fights near it, both menus at once, a's menu while
# b is far away, a talk with the field recorder.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@90
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log in the field alone
fight 455 15 80 until enemy<14 or frames>=3000 fail stagechange,frames>=2990
log case 1: a alone opens its menu among the enemies
menu until menu=1 fail stagechange
browse until frames>=420 fail stagechange,menu=0
shot a1_alone_menu
idle until lost>=1 or frames>=4000 fail stagechange,menu=0,frames>=3990
log a was hit in its menu while alone
idle until present=2 or frames>=24000 fail stagechange,dead,menu=0,frames>=23990
log case 2: b joined while a is in its menu
idle until near<45 or frames>=1500 fail stagechange,menu=0
log case 2b: b fights near a while a is in its menu
idle until frames>=420 fail stagechange,menu=0
shot a2_menu_b_joined
menu close until menu=0 fail stagechange
log a closed its menu
fight 440 20 60 until frames>=300 fail stagechange
log a played on after its menu
idle until near<70 or frames>=2400 fail stagechange
log case 3: a opens its menu while b fights near it
menu until menu=1 fail stagechange
browse until frames>=420 fail stagechange,menu=0
shot a3_menu_b_near
idle until frames>=600 fail stagechange,menu=0
menu close until menu=0 fail stagechange
log case 4: both open their menus
idle until menus>=1 or frames>=2400 fail stagechange
menu until menus=2 fail stagechange,frames>=1800
log both menus are open
idle until frames>=120 fail stagechange,menu=0
shot a4_both_menus
idle until frames>=300 fail stagechange,menu=0
menu close until menu=0 fail stagechange
idle until menus=0 fail stagechange
log case 5: a opens its menu while b is far away
idle until apart>150 or frames>=3600 fail stagechange
menu until menu=1 fail stagechange
idle until frames>=180 fail stagechange,menu=0
shot a5_menu_b_far
idle until frames>=420 fail stagechange,menu=0
menu close until menu=0 fail stagechange
idle until apart>280 or frames>=3600 fail stagechange
log case 6: a talks with the field recorder while b moves
talkto n_recorder#1 until talking=1 or frames>=2400 fail stagechange,frames>=2390
log a talks
idle until frames>=90 fail stagechange
shot a6_talk
talkto n_recorder#1 until talking=0,frames>=60 fail stagechange
log a read the recorder
idle until frames>=1800
